   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kafue Gorge RTC Upgrading</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kafue Gorge RTC upgrading</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Kafue Gorge Regional Training Centre, KGRTC, genom utbildning i ny teknik, s&#xe4;kerhet, ny simulatorutrustning, management och marekting. St&#xf6;det inkluderar &#xe4;ven uppgradering av laboratorier. Utvecklingsm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra driften av vattenkraftsanl&#xe4;ggningar vilket ger en &#xf6;kad tillg&#xe5;ng av h&#xe5;llball och p&#xe5;litligt vattenkraft.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Kafue Gorge Regional Training Centre, KGRTC, covering training efforts in new technology, in safety aspects, in new simulator equipmen, in managament and marketing. Includes also upgrading of the laboratories. One of the development objectives are to improve management of hydropower facilities which provides sustainable and reliable hydropower.</narrative>
